1
00:00:00,704 --> 00:00:05,004
(Howard:)If y'all don't mind,
I got a hankering for a Lone Star Beer.

2
00:00:06,418 --> 00:00:10,758
(Mrs Cooper:)There's no alcohol in this household,
stop talking like that and lose the hat.

3
00:00:12,633 --> 00:00:15,973
(Howard:)Sorry. I'll take a diet Yoo-hoo
if you have it.

4
00:00:16,762 --> 00:00:17,802
(Mrs Cooper:)You'll take a cola.

5
00:00:19,181 --> 00:00:21,311
What about you? Raj, is it?

6
00:00:21,767 --> 00:00:24,607
(Mrs Cooper:)Oh, you still having trouble talking
to the ladies? Ha-ha-ha.

7
00:00:24,770 --> 00:00:26,440
(Mrs Cooper:)Because, you know, at our church...

8
00:00:26,605 --> 00:00:28,645
(Mrs Cooper:)...we have a woman
who's an amazing healer.

9
00:00:28,816 --> 00:00:31,606
Mostly she does crutch
and wheelchair people...

10
00:00:31,777 --> 00:00:34,067
(Mrs Cooper:)...but I bet she'd be willing
to take a shot...

11
00:00:34,238 --> 00:00:37,528
...at whatever Third-World demon
is running around inside of you.

12
00:00:39,994 --> 00:00:43,164
If you don't mind, there's a 3:05
nonstop back to Los Angeles...

13
00:00:43,330 --> 00:00:45,960
...and you have no idea
how much I wanna be on it.

14
00:00:46,625 --> 00:00:48,965
(Mrs Cooper:)-A girl?
-Uh, yes, ma'am.

15
00:00:49,128 --> 00:00:51,458
(Mrs Cooper:)Oh, good. I've been praying for you.

16
00:00:54,550 --> 00:00:56,760
(Mrs Cooper:)Oh, Sheldon.

17
00:00:56,927 --> 00:00:58,177
(Sheldon:)What are they doing here?

